MavenGradle <p>Add the following dependency to your <code>pom.xml</code>:</p> <pre><code>&lt;dependency&gt;
    &lt;groupId&gt;org.codarama&lt;/groupId&gt;
    &lt;artifactId&gt;redlock4j&lt;/artifactId&gt;
    &lt;version&gt;1.1.0&lt;/version&gt;
&lt;/dependency&gt;

&lt;!-- Choose one Redis client --&gt;

&lt;!-- For Jedis: --&gt;
&lt;dependency&gt;
    &lt;groupId&gt;redis.clients&lt;/groupId&gt;
    &lt;artifactId&gt;jedis&lt;/artifactId&gt;
    &lt;version&gt;7.1.0&lt;/version&gt;
&lt;/dependency&gt;

&lt;!-- Or for Lettuce: --&gt;
&lt;dependency&gt;
    &lt;groupId&gt;io.lettuce&lt;/groupId&gt;
    &lt;artifactId&gt;lettuce-core&lt;/artifactId&gt;
    &lt;version&gt;7.1.0.RELEASE&lt;/version&gt;
&lt;/dependency&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Add the following to your <code>build.gradle</code>:</p> <pre><code>dependencies {
    implementation 'org.codarama:redlock4j:1.1.0'

    // Choose one Redis client:
    // For Jedis:
    implementation 'redis.clients:jedis:7.1.0'

    // Or for Lettuce:
    implementation 'io.lettuce:lettuce-core:7.1.0.RELEASE'
}
</code></pre>
